<title>GREECE: TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP NARROWS TO 398BPS, 301 VS BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP NARROWS TO 398BPS, 301 VS BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds narrowed to 398 basis points on Thursday from Wednesday's 403.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap widened to 300 basis points from 299 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.65%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.67%	398	403 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.62%	403	409 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.64%	300	299 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.35%	330	334 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.33%	333	336 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.15%	250	255 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    5.87%	378	338 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0930 GMT. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
